: "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:48:32Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Escalator?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:48:55Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "I jumped the gun", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:48:57Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Treppenwitz is", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:49:18Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "That thing where you are reminded of a retort after the argument?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:49:39Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Ryan had asked this in his german word quiz", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:49:48Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Correct, it means you think of a great retort only after you reach the bottom of the staircase, i.e. after you left the conversation", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:49:58Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Here", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:50:07Z", "username": "Naman Agarwal", "text": "Hindi mein ise 'abey yaar' bolte hain", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]